hadiths[16]{hadithnumber,text}:
"538","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mas'ud Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jis din Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke bete Ibrahim ki wafaat hui us din suraj grahan laga, to logon ne kaha: Suraj grahan Ibrahim ki wafaat ki wajah se laga hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Suraj aur chand Allah Azza wa Jalla ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain, inhen kisi ki maut ya zindagi ki wajah se grahan nahin lagta, to jab tum yeh dekho to Allah ke zikr aur namaz ki taraf jaldi karo.'"
"539","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Suraj ko grahan lag gaya to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz padhi. Ibn Abbas ne bayan kiya ke Aap ki namaz do rak'aten thin, har rak'at mein do ruku' the, phir Aap ne unhen khutba diya to farmaya: 'Suraj aur chand Allah Azza wa Jalla ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain, inhen kisi ki maut ya zindagi ki wajah se grahan nahin lagta, to jab tum yeh dekho to Allah ke zikr ki taraf jaldi karo.'"
"540","[AI-translation] Urwah se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai."
"541","[AI-translation] Aur Yahya bin Sa'id se, Amrah se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Suraj ko grahan lag gaya to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz padhi. Unhon ne bayan kiya ke Aap ne do rak'aten padhin, har rak'at mein do ruku' the."
"542","[AI-translation] Kaseer bin Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne suraj grahan mein do rak'aten namaz padhi, har rak'at mein do ruku' the."
"543","[AI-translation] Tawus se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Suraj ko grahan lag gaya to Ibn Abbas ne hamen Zamzam ke sehan mein namaz padhai, chhe ruku' phir chaar sajde kiye."
"544","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke suraj ko grahan lag gaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz padhi. To unhon ne Aap ki namaz ka tareeqa bayan kiya ke do rak'aten thin, har rak'at mein do ruku' the."
"545","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"546","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa Ash'ari (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl hai."
"547","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se, Amr ya Safwan se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Safwan ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas ko dekha ke unhon ne Zamzam ki pusht par suraj aur chand grahan ke liye namaz padhi, do rak'aten, har rak'at mein do ruku' the."
"548","[AI-translation] Hasan se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke chand ko grahan lag gaya jabke Ibn Abbas Basrah mein the. To Ibn Abbas nikle aur unhon ne hamen do rak'aten padhain, har rak'at mein do ruku' the, phir sawar ho kar hamen khutba diya to farmaya: Main ne isi tarah namaz padhi jaise main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko padhte dekha tha. Aur farmaya: Suraj aur chand Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain, inhen kisi ki maut ya zindagi ki wajah se grahan nahin lagta, to jab tum in mein se kuch ko grahan laga dekho to tumhari daud Allah Ta'ala ki taraf honi chahiye."
"549","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Suraj ko grahan lag gaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz padhi aur log Aap ke sath the. Aap ne lamba qiyam kiya, kaha: Taqreeban Surah Baqarah ki tilawat ke barabar. Kaha: Phir lamba ruku' kiya, phir uthe to lamba qiyam kiya jo pahle qiyam se kam tha, phir lamba ruku' kiya jo pahle ruku' se kam tha, phir sajda kiya. Phir khade hue to lamba qiyam kiya jo pahle qiyam se kam tha, phir lamba ruku' kiya jo pahle ruku' se kam tha, phir uthe to lamba qiyam kiya jo pahle qiyam se kam tha, phir lamba ruku' kiya jo pahle ruku' se kam tha, phir sajda kiya. Phir Aap phir gae jabke suraj roshan ho chuka tha. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Suraj aur chand Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain, inhen kisi ki maut ya zindagi ki wajah se grahan nahin lagta, to jab tum yeh dekho to Allah ka zikr karo.' Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham ne dekha ke Aap ne apni jagah par kisi cheez ki taraf hath badhaya, phir ham ne dekha ke goya Aap peeche hate. Aap ne farmaya: 'Main ne jannat dekhi ya mujhe dikhai gai, to main ne us mein se ek khosha lena chaha, aur agar main use le leta to tum rehti duniya tak us mein se khate. Aur main ne jahannum dekhi ya mujhe dikhai gai, to main ne aaj jaise manzar kabhi nahin dekha, aur main ne us ke aksar rahne walon ko aurten dekha.' Unhon ne kaha: Kyun, Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: 'Un ke kufr ki wajah se.' Kaha gaya: Kya woh Allah ka kufr karti hain? Farmaya: 'Shohar ki nashukri aur ehsan faramoshi karti hain. Agar tum un mein se kisi ke sath zamana bhar ehsan karo, phir woh tum se koi cheez dekhe to kahegi: Main ne tum se kabhi bhalai nahin dekhi.'"
"550","[AI-translation] Hasan se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke chand ko grahan lag gaya jabke Ibn Abbas Basrah mein the. To Ibn Abbas nikle aur hamen do rak'aten padhain, har rak'at mein do ruku' the, phir sawar ho kar hamen khutba diya to farmaya: Main ne isi tarah namaz padhi jaise main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko padhte dekha, aur farmaya: Suraj aur chand Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain, inhen kisi ki maut ya zindagi ki wajah se grahan nahin lagta, to jab tum in mein se kuch ko grahan laga dekho to tumhari daud Allah ki taraf honi chahiye."
"551","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke suraj ko grahan lag gaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz padhi. To unhon ne Aap ki namaz ka tareeqa bayan kiya ke do rak'aten thin, har rak'at mein do ruku' the."
"552","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi tarah riwayat hai."
"553","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa Ash'ari (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl hai."
